{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_04_beg","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_04","title":"惊愕","storyCode":"LE-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4414e3d68d4597bd4c9861fb99c6e19c7c09caeb62a2d4866e387eb88dbcd344","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g6_whitehome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来了，来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......芙蓉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好......你起得好早啊，天刚刚亮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键？黑键还在睡啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼睛好红，难道是熬夜了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——把他也叫起来，赶快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假愈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全听不懂你想说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是真的听不懂，还是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我再解释一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来夕照区，是为了调查这里感染者异常好转的现象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但根据我们这几天的走访，夕照区的感染者并不是好转，而是“假愈”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是说，病人的状况看起来好转了，实际上却是在恶化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么明明恶化了，看起来还像是好转？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我这么说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般来说，身体受到损伤之后，最好的结局是“恢复原状”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果做不到恢复原状，身体就会调动没受损的部分，去补偿在损伤中失去的功能，我们一般称为“代偿”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在夕照区的大多数感染者，身体的代偿功能都被异常调动起来，导致他们看起来状态非常好，有的甚至和健康人看不出区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，在看不见的地方，在体内，矿石病的感染程度正在快速加深......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照现在的速度，即将有一批人进展到失代偿阶段了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失代偿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"损伤的程度超出了身体最大的代偿能力，脆弱的平衡被打破，患者进入矿石病的急性发作期，病情急转直下，危及生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事实上，已经有人进入急性发作期了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你的意思了，但这和我们有什么关系——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，难道说白垩也危险了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问题不在这儿，根据对调查结果的分析......你和白垩，似乎是引发这一切的主要因素。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和白垩是引发这一切的主要因素？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么梦话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在分析了你们的行动轨迹之后，我可以确定，你们......或者你们携带着的什么东西，与假愈现象的发生有着极强的相关性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如你们住所隔壁洗衣店的女工，前天还说自己“感觉特别好”，昨天夜里病情恶化，差点被送进感染者临终事务处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在恳请你们配合，如果有任何线索，请立刻告诉我！这是为了夕照区所有人的生命安全着想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键&白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全想不起来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实想不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以防万一，你们两人跟我去一趟办事处，让我检查一下，可以吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从指标上看，一个是再正常不过的健康人，一个是稳定期的矿石病患者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么可能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，这次是夕照厅后面乐器店的老板！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——情况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，老板和高庭区的医院签过协议，人已经被接走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是假愈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，他昨天下午报告的是“没有任何不适”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去跟进一下，免得医院方面在协议上耍手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们俩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再问一遍，你们有任何能想到的线索吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在时间就是生命，拜托了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样，黑键，你先出来，我们单独聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，你在屋里等一会儿，好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"单独把我叫出来是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有误判的地方我很抱歉，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你和白垩立刻在空间上分开，越快越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么找我，不找他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怀疑所谓的“假愈”是我故意所为？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实很希望你就是整件事的罪魁祸首，这样我就可以直接把你交给维谢海姆的治安官，从根源上解决问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但假愈现象在你到来之前就已经开始，并且被行板注意到了，否则我也不会来维谢海姆，来夕照区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你凭什么说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，在我来之前？那白垩呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假愈现象的出现......就在他来维谢海姆之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在他来维谢海姆之后......怎么会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几乎就是白垩来到夕照区的同时，一部分感染者的指标就开始缓缓变好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他那时对感染者的影响很微弱，除了细心的行板，没人发现这一现象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到你们在报名会上相遇之后，白垩的影响陡然增强了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照之前行板发回给罗德岛本舰的报告，如果只有白垩，情况恶化到现在这种程度，至少要半年时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来了之后，短短几天时间，就......变成了现在这个样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你向我解释这到底是怎么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不能解释，至少也要在情况变得不可收拾之前踩下刹车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我希望你能尽快离开夕照区，离开维谢海姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"音乐会呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"音乐会——说什么傻话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如假愈现象是由某种法术引起的，你们的合奏大概率会将其增强——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说......这就是你的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实话实说，我非常讨厌这种无端受到怀疑的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是你说讨厌就能解决的问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，给我一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多长时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快的话几个小时，慢的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道，但我保证会来找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我相信你一次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键好不容易才获得了参加音乐会的资格，好不容易才得到了车尔尼先生的认可......在这种时候半途而废，实在太可惜了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是认可不认可的问题，是人命关天的大事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，你要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看起来气喘吁吁，难道是一路跑来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不推荐您用这种方式来找我，暴露的可能性——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴露？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，您还谈什么暴露？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问您，您所谓的尘世之音的共振，会不会对其他人造成影响？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共振？不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不是刻意驱使，尘世之音的共振不会对人产生任何影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么芙蓉把我和白垩当成假愈现象的源头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛来维谢海姆出差的干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛把这种现象称为“假愈”？不愧是专业人士，精准而简洁的描述方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......果然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您说的是最近发生在夕照区的感染者身上的异常现象，我确实知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一言以蔽之，白垩体内的尘世之音是损坏的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"损坏的？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在您施展法术时，体内的尘世之音会被激活，为您提供帮助，没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我确实会在施术时隐约听见一段刺耳的旋律，但这种东西怎么可能损坏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩的尘世之音一直处在异常激活的状态，不存在如您现在一般“关闭”的状况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换句话说，他一直在不自觉地向周围施术，而他自己无法控制这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你去问他，他很可能会说，他一直都能隐约听见某种旋律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以将这种现象理解为“泄漏”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓“假愈”，就是他的尘世之音泄漏的后果——无差别地提高周围的源石活性，利用源石的能量“治愈”周围的感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，用以治愈感染者的能量之源，是感染者自己体内的源石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以感染者自己为法术装置，以他们体内的源石为能源，增进他们的代偿功能......这就是白垩的尘世之音引发的“假愈”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概从很久以前，白垩就一直保持着这样的状态，一直在影响着周围的感染者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一直都是这样，他的异常早就应该被人发现了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是您的功劳了，黑键先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共振。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......共振增强了白垩尘世之音的泄漏，所以假愈现象才会在这几天集中爆发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全正确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我完全明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我退出您的这场计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就这么放弃了唾手可得的自由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没疯到用一整个地块的感染者换自由的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您被罗德岛的人吓住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假愈确实谈不上是好事，但您和白垩的音乐会几天后就要举行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到这几天过去，您的尘世之音被除掉，然后再离开维谢海姆，也不会多死几个感染者的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的机会千载难逢，您现在走了，乌提卡伯爵这个身份就将跟您一辈子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您真的想这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不想，但我不能那么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，格特鲁德女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟您无关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的脚步不是很稳。头痛发作了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经说过了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟你无关！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
